  "reasoning": "The claim that mRNA COVID-19 vaccines alter or permanently change human DNA is biologically false. According to established scientific consensus and major health organizations (including the CDC, WHO, and NIH), messenger RNA (mRNA) from the vaccines remains in the cytoplasm of the cell to instruct ribosomes to produce the viral spike protein. It never enters the cell nucleus where genomic DNA is housed. Furthermore, mRNA degrades naturally within days and cannot integrate into or alter human DNA.",
